### Mutate test.txt through the upload endpoint (VS Code REST Client: "Send Request" above)
### The response carries the mutated file under its original name via Content-Disposition.

POST http://localhost:5000/files/mutate
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FileMutationBoundary

------FileMutationBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./test.txt
------FileMutationBoundary--
